     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This update improves compatibility with the recent <b><a href=\"https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343060704000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1MN27wqjGEpdmBMa-WC3Fc\">ggplot2</a></b> update and also introduces functionality for fitted model objects created using the new <b><a href=\"https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/rstanarm/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/rstanarm/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343060704000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wnwkhmRz4fS_lrLiu1YYJ\">rstanarm</a></b> package. A few other minor notes are available on the <a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/shinystan/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/shinystan/releases&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343060704000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KEIf3UfhxXH4URO_ZbHe8\">GitHub release page</a>.<div><br></div><div>To install from CRAN: </div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;shinystan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></font><div><br></div></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To install from GitHub:</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(!</span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;devtools&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;devtools&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>devtools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">install_github</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stan-dev/shinystan&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> build_vignettes </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code></div><br><br></div></div>"
